<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Fresenius Medical Care.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Fresenius Medical Care.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. New York said it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Fresenius Medical Care. There are already two calls outstanding with strikes of 100 marks and 120 marks.</p>
<p>COMMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	06.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUSS, FRFT		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  131.00 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>	     STRIKE	ISSUE	  PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL	140 DEM     20.0 DEM     22.13 PCT</p>
<p> CALL	160 DEM    13.50 DEM     32.40 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
